      "writtenOn": "2023-06-06T09:35:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The original problem is that the constructor of OnSubscriptionsChangedListener is using the current thread to make a HandlerExecutor (throws if prepare is not called). Even though the executor to registered is BackgroundThread(or anything else), it still (unnecessarily) forces the creation of that HandlerExecutor.\n\nI think a more appropriate solution would be to construct the listener in the background thread.",
