      "writtenOn": "2023-06-06T09:35:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case, there is a known subId, so I think it is more likely that there should be a carrierId and if it was not in the cache it was just missed due to the cache not being updated in time. \n\nPer the discussion in the other comment however, I agree that it should be unlikely for this case to occur but when it does, it is still possible to get the value from TelephonyManager. Maybe it does not need to be done now, but at least add a TODO.",
      "parentUuid": "9287bec6_78111d36",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 362,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 362,
        "endChar": 85
