      "writtenOn": "2023-06-06T09:49:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think it is necessarily possible to get the value from TelephonyManager in this case. There are times where the getter returns UNKNOWN_CARRIER_ID, especially shortly after boot. I would also bet that there are race conditions where the synchronous getter returns a stale value because of poor synchronization.",
      "parentUuid": "840db5c6_1c8ae940",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 362,
        "startChar": 11,
        "endLine": 362,
        "endChar": 85
      },
      "revId": "f1edb8cac7bdfaa5c3d82a788d274ad603fd0b72",
